{"kind": "localization-tw-scoped-source-policy", "version": 1, "id": "3a85d1af9a40973a510b011701cddadee66b7ecf0c3747e92d9f974ff21884c3", "question_id": "row-2", "number": 2, "title": "account → 身分識別：這筆來源應如何使用？", "conflict_id": "2512815eed7ee5d489ff78a1", "fingerprint": "bf0f972121592b592a4887f7c29694498795dfa88798e2b0283d918fbc8450b2", "focus_ids": ["microsoft:21638_779054_2087635"], "held_source_ids": [], "choice": "retain-context", "decision_text": "保留「身分識別」這筆來源，註明存取屬性語境及產品原句待補；實際採用前核對語境（建議）。", "scope": "帳戶、帳號、會計科目與客戶可以依語境並存。這次只需處理你有勾的「身分識別」：來源描述使用者可存取網路或系統的屬性集合，但未附可核對的產品原句。不能只因譯名不常見就判錯，也還不足以當成 account 的通用譯法。", "note": "", "reviewed_by": "", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-09T10:05:56.120Z", "source_verification": "still-required", "resolves_whole_conflict": false, "provenance": {"file_name": "review-human-only-answered.html", "file_sha256": "fbc9c3a37a15d68ed19ba1c7a1a478b821294bd8a9246a7eb4c63b01b1d8b458", "bundle_id": "455707d53cd91d0cb791c435d69391193194dcf88d1590b2187fe68ca7622891", "snapshot_id": "2026-09-09T10:11:16.201Z-ka1ih0s2ubi", "received_at": "2026-09-09T10:19:06+00:00"}}
{"kind": "localization-tw-scoped-source-policy", "version": 1, "id": "990a27e1e43d0eb493c622a05a7e4f6f91ea06286eaf5df0a1cf3819f8570e79", "question_id": "row-6", "number": 6, "title": "audio：只確認這筆來源的詞性與釋義表述如何處理", "conflict_id": "2f40530943530724a470def5", "fingerprint": "a3a57a6e7b9454250a0dd82c59daa38ccf978e9b76d455c7797c29a63f5c1ad0", "focus_ids": ["microsoft:10451_16349_16367"], "held_source_ids": [], "choice": "retain-context", "decision_text": "保留 audio → 音訊；這筆來源的詞性與表述加註待核對，不影響其他音訊候選（建議）。", "scope": "技術上的「音訊／音訊檔案」可以保留；《簡編本》「音訊」的消息義另列，不用重新選。剩餘疑點只在這筆 Microsoft 資料：詞性標成 Noun，英文釋義卻採形容詞式表述。跨語言詞性本來就可能不同，這項差異本身不能證明譯名或整筆資料錯誤。", "note": "", "reviewed_by": "", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-09T10:06:19.068Z", "source_verification": "still-required", "resolves_whole_conflict": false, "provenance": {"file_name": "review-human-only-answered.html", "file_sha256": "fbc9c3a37a15d68ed19ba1c7a1a478b821294bd8a9246a7eb4c63b01b1d8b458", "bundle_id": "455707d53cd91d0cb791c435d69391193194dcf88d1590b2187fe68ca7622891", "snapshot_id": "2026-09-09T10:11:16.201Z-ka1ih0s2ubi", "received_at": "2026-09-09T10:19:06+00:00"}}
{"kind": "localization-tw-scoped-source-policy", "version": 1, "id": "0def97fda4d1aec6750ed99b07e99f560f681c15cdc48f29ac3d8dce823218fe", "question_id": "row-7", "number": 7, "title": "call → 撥號／撥打：缺少原產品句子的兩筆如何處理？", "conflict_id": "6a2de4f691d48bff68963962", "fingerprint": "730464b5d87a5b18c74bb276b9da8c872d22425bd6eb634be53a568c8101b418", "focus_ids": ["microsoft:6186_418609_1380101", "microsoft:6186_418609_2510586"], "held_source_ids": [], "choice": "retain-context", "decision_text": "保留這兩筆，限定為待核對的電話操作用法；取得原句後再決定適用範圍（建議）。", "scope": "程式呼叫、電話通話、撥號／撥打與 CALL 函式可以依用途並存。你有勾的這兩筆以語音通話作定義，中文則是動作詞「撥號／撥打」；如果出現在按鈕或操作指示，可能成立。尚缺原句，不能只按英文名詞標記判錯。", "note": "", "reviewed_by": "", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-09T10:06:34.257Z", "source_verification": "still-required", "resolves_whole_conflict": false, "provenance": {"file_name": "review-human-only-answered.html", "file_sha256": "fbc9c3a37a15d68ed19ba1c7a1a478b821294bd8a9246a7eb4c63b01b1d8b458", "bundle_id": "455707d53cd91d0cb791c435d69391193194dcf88d1590b2187fe68ca7622891", "snapshot_id": "2026-09-09T10:11:16.201Z-ka1ih0s2ubi", "received_at": "2026-09-09T10:19:06+00:00"}}
{"kind": "localization-tw-scoped-source-policy", "version": 1, "id": "ec5679144931afff2ebbf1c766bad0cba394d60aa986d93a16f15424565408f7", "question_id": "row-10", "number": 10, "title": "code：兩條語意可疑的來源配對要先暫停嗎？", "conflict_id": "e82d9930ce6c0c3ca5db24a7", "fingerprint": "2f1c5ed6c7b1a9b58b50f173398397deb5049d42fb8d7b835daf179a3922990d", "focus_ids": ["microsoft:1810_33647_33662", "microsoft:3397_33620_33638"], "held_source_ids": ["microsoft:1810_33647_33662", "microsoft:3397_33620_33638"], "choice": "hold-mapping", "decision_text": "先暫停這兩條配對，保留原始來源；其他 code 對應依語境使用（建議）。", "scope": "疑點一：描述符號系統的定義，中文配成「撰寫」。疑點二：描述撰寫程式指令的動作，中文配成「字碼」。這是定義與譯詞的語意疑點，不是單純詞性不同。程式碼、代碼、編碼、撰寫程式與 CODE 函式仍依語境保留。原截圖未拍到本筆勾選區，因此這裡不推定你原先選了哪個。若兩條要分別處理，可選自行說明。", "note": "", "reviewed_by": "", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-09T10:07:27.477Z", "source_verification": "still-required", "resolves_whole_conflict": false, "provenance": {"file_name": "review-human-only-answered.html", "file_sha256": "fbc9c3a37a15d68ed19ba1c7a1a478b821294bd8a9246a7eb4c63b01b1d8b458", "bundle_id": "455707d53cd91d0cb791c435d69391193194dcf88d1590b2187fe68ca7622891", "snapshot_id": "2026-09-09T10:11:16.201Z-ka1ih0s2ubi", "received_at": "2026-09-09T10:19:06+00:00"}}
{"kind": "localization-tw-scoped-source-policy", "version": 1, "id": "fa1f43629fbdb942ab4737a5d64a6e9dd2353e8635a9c25fc217d07af2a8d471", "question_id": "row-12", "number": 12, "title": "control → 視覺效果：要保留為待查的產品用法嗎？", "conflict_id": "11d78efcec87d6d5ab26b4de", "fingerprint": "ff117fd851a16539a792d54518d3f5b063adacd8622be7a3e915794e53f2a7c7", "focus_ids": ["microsoft:4835_39274_2104807"], "held_source_ids": ["microsoft:4835_39274_2104807"], "choice": "hold-mapping", "decision_text": "先暫停 control → 視覺效果這條配對，保留原始來源及其他 control 候選（建議）。", "scope": "控制、控制項、元件與控制措施可以有不同或上下位關係。剩餘疑點是「視覺效果」這筆：來源定義為可互動、輸入、顯示資訊或設定值的物件，但沒有產品句子可證明這個譯法。不能逕自當成一般 control 的對應。原截圖未拍到本筆勾選區。", "note": "", "reviewed_by": "", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-09T10:07:41.403Z", "source_verification": "still-required", "resolves_whole_conflict": false, "provenance": {"file_name": "review-human-only-answered.html", "file_sha256": "fbc9c3a37a15d68ed19ba1c7a1a478b821294bd8a9246a7eb4c63b01b1d8b458", "bundle_id": "455707d53cd91d0cb791c435d69391193194dcf88d1590b2187fe68ca7622891", "snapshot_id": "2026-09-09T10:11:16.201Z-ka1ih0s2ubi", "received_at": "2026-09-09T10:19:06+00:00"}}
{"kind": "localization-tw-scoped-source-policy", "version": 1, "id": "6df8a14432df8e28d9130cb289894a3630b7dd2148b29f7bcff4db4bbff5b34c", "question_id": "row-33", "number": 33, "title": "thread → 發佈反應：你有勾的這筆如何限定語境？", "conflict_id": "bd6ffbb3c1d025cc28cd58b5", "fingerprint": "9c104616c967dd312d7ab1221cbe82669df5ed8bd2d504df4771172050ad90ba", "focus_ids": ["microsoft:30904_1567776_2246024"], "held_source_ids": [], "choice": "retain-context", "decision_text": "保留「發佈反應」，註明社群反應集合的來源語境與產品原句待補；不與電腦執行緒混為同義（建議）。", "scope": "電腦執行緒、對話／討論串可以並存。這次只問你有勾的「發佈反應」：來源描述所有已發佈反應的集合，但缺少產品原句，需確認是功能名稱、動作標籤還是集合名稱。另外，把相同社群定義配成「執行緒」的可疑來源，你原先沒有勾；該筆維持原紀錄，不要求你重答。", "note": "", "reviewed_by": "", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-09T10:07:54.515Z", "source_verification": "still-required", "resolves_whole_conflict": false, "provenance": {"file_name": "review-human-only-answered.html", "file_sha256": "fbc9c3a37a15d68ed19ba1c7a1a478b821294bd8a9246a7eb4c63b01b1d8b458", "bundle_id": "455707d53cd91d0cb791c435d69391193194dcf88d1590b2187fe68ca7622891", "snapshot_id": "2026-09-09T10:11:16.201Z-ka1ih0s2ubi", "received_at": "2026-09-09T10:19:06+00:00"}}
{"kind": "localization-tw-scoped-source-policy", "version": 1, "id": "88fc2ce0871a0a07d293fe798060f07aea383d2bccc6015029c678b8a1e48249", "question_id": "row-63", "number": 63, "title": "塑封 → 膠膜／護貝：來源未說明的使用範圍如何記錄？", "conflict_id": "2901c1a5dd572a4611388a2c", "fingerprint": "d5546013e595b557847ac7b64daa1bd030baab02dc2771a9e723f2b8233e175a", "focus_ids": ["linguipedia:85", "linguipedia:98"], "held_source_ids": [], "choice": "retain-context", "decision_text": "依知識庫保留兩組對應，註明材料／加工／成品的細部適用範圍待補；遇到實際句子再判斷（建議）。", "scope": "中華語文知識庫列有「塑封／膠膜」與「过塑、塑封／護貝」兩組，你都有勾。現有來源未附完整材料或加工釋義，《簡編本》也沒有本次可用的直接詞目。材料、加工、成品之間的區分只能暫定，還不能宣稱兩組完全同義或互斥。", "note": "", "reviewed_by": "", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-09T10:08:06.471Z", "source_verification": "still-required", "resolves_whole_conflict": false, "provenance": {"file_name": "review-human-only-answered.html", "file_sha256": "fbc9c3a37a15d68ed19ba1c7a1a478b821294bd8a9246a7eb4c63b01b1d8b458", "bundle_id": "455707d53cd91d0cb791c435d69391193194dcf88d1590b2187fe68ca7622891", "snapshot_id": "2026-09-09T10:11:16.201Z-ka1ih0s2ubi", "received_at": "2026-09-09T10:19:06+00:00"}}
{"kind": "localization-tw-scoped-source-policy", "version": 1, "id": "7f655d211adabac431fcbdbc9e2cdb6abd1a6282b7d33c1f53f7decd7b555b34", "question_id": "row-64", "number": 64, "title": "耳朵眼儿 → 耳洞／耳道：口語指稱的範圍如何保留？", "conflict_id": "13e1b3d09eaefcb73d58d0f9", "fingerprint": "75f3bf4676c95bd3108692f96c7fec43d1b21f57d8d228a23a2e6766894d4e53", "focus_ids": ["linguipedia:1657", "linguipedia:1658"], "held_source_ids": [], "choice": "retain-context", "decision_text": "保留兩組；解剖語境附外耳道／外聽道的釋義，耳洞的口語指稱待實際句子確認（建議）。", "scope": "你勾了知識庫的兩組：耳洞，以及耳道／外耳道／外聽道。《簡編本》的外聽道指外耳通往鼓膜的構造，並列外耳道。耳洞的口語指稱仍要看句子，不能直接限定為穿耳孔。需要補充的是這個語境邊界，不是重新選唯一譯名。", "note": "", "reviewed_by": "", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-09T10:08:19.618Z", "source_verification": "still-required", "resolves_whole_conflict": false, "provenance": {"file_name": "review-human-only-answered.html", "file_sha256": "fbc9c3a37a15d68ed19ba1c7a1a478b821294bd8a9246a7eb4c63b01b1d8b458", "bundle_id": "455707d53cd91d0cb791c435d69391193194dcf88d1590b2187fe68ca7622891", "snapshot_id": "2026-09-09T10:11:16.201Z-ka1ih0s2ubi", "received_at": "2026-09-09T10:19:06+00:00"}}
{"kind": "localization-tw-scoped-source-policy", "version": 1, "id": "a8ebc398b7963f3ce7475f053258d95ff9ce6b776e282708e897e148fdab3db5", "question_id": "row-67", "number": 67, "title": "袜裤 → 套褲／褲襪：服裝形制尚未確認，如何處理？", "conflict_id": "fb9e6fa2baf1f7325b9c038b", "fingerprint": "f7167a71bcac51e3e34c68552182f25d8d7cd48eac88c37572966d0279b2a629", "focus_ids": ["linguipedia:379", "linguipedia:387"], "held_source_ids": [], "choice": "retain-context", "decision_text": "保留兩組知識庫對應，註明服裝形制及用例待補；不先設定兩詞完全同義或互斥（建議）。", "scope": "你勾了知識庫的套褲與褲襪兩組。《簡編本》把褲襪解釋為像褲子的貼身長襪；本次沒有套褲的完整詞目或對應圖示。現有資料無法保證兩組在所有形制上都相同，也不足以斷言一定不同。", "note": "", "reviewed_by": "", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-09T10:08:38.397Z", "source_verification": "still-required", "resolves_whole_conflict": false, "provenance": {"file_name": "review-human-only-answered.html", "file_sha256": "fbc9c3a37a15d68ed19ba1c7a1a478b821294bd8a9246a7eb4c63b01b1d8b458", "bundle_id": "455707d53cd91d0cb791c435d69391193194dcf88d1590b2187fe68ca7622891", "snapshot_id": "2026-09-09T10:11:16.201Z-ka1ih0s2ubi", "received_at": "2026-09-09T10:19:06+00:00"}}
{"kind": "localization-tw-scoped-source-policy", "version": 1, "id": "97840f13a54a0294ae9fe4c824e0bc76938d3a4051fd9c07800e1164e385c931", "question_id": "2d87c054", "title": "widget", "conflict_id": "8a3399829d91bccd67a6b50a", "fingerprint": "185eef55ea34207e9681ec9bbd9a32dbcc972a22a4bc376e8b4b833b19aa61f3", "focus_ids": ["microsoft:34203_1987195_2246029"], "held_source_ids": ["microsoft:34203_1987195_2246029"], "choice": "hold-mapping", "decision_text": "不採用標示的大陸或港式形式，只暫停指定來源；同組其他形式保留。", "scope": "只適用於該組列出的微軟術語庫來源；不推定整個英文詞或中文詞是否禁用。", "note": "小工具 / 桌面小工具：用於手機或電腦桌面，不需要打開完整 App 就能直接看天氣、行事曆或待辦事項。\n但以下用法不確定：• 控件 / 元件：在軟體開發中，指按鈕、文字框、下拉選單等互動元素。\n• 微件 / 小部件\n頂多元件較常聽到，但元件同時適用於很多領域\n除了第一個小工具 / 桌面小工具可APPROVE，其他若無足夠證據支持，可維持英文原字", "reviewed_by": "", "reviewed_at": "2026-09-29T11:00:45.254Z", "source_verification": "not-applicable", "resolves_whole_conflict": false, "provenance": {"file_name": "glossary-regional-review-answered.json", "file_sha256": "dc436f16bb40e033a6a9f472a6d18a5fc0d592abaf786748a22c7cfb140fad18", "received_at": "2026-09-29T11:03:21+00:00"}}
